    "notes": "<p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><strong>Ivan Dubov</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Occupation:</strong> Machine Operator<br><strong>Age:</strong> 25<br><strong>Personality:</strong> Rebellious</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>ATTRIBUTES</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>STRENGTH:</strong> 5<br><strong>WITS:</strong> 2<br><strong>EMPATHY:</strong> 2<br><strong>AGILITY:</strong> 5</p>\n<p><strong>HEALTH:</strong> 5</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>SKILLS</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Heavy Machinery:</strong> 4</li>\n<li><strong>Close Combat:</strong> 3</li>\n<li><strong>Manipulation:</strong> 1</li>\n<li><strong>Ranged Combat:</strong> 2</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>TALENTS</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>The Long Haul</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Buddy:</strong> Pham<br><strong>Rival:</strong> Liu</p>\n<p><strong>Signature Item:</strong> Cigarette Case</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>EQUIPMENT</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Razor-Sharp Switchblade</strong> (DMG 2)</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>Backstory</strong></h3>\n<p>Ivan Dubov is an underwater welder specializing in deep-sea operations. Once a free spirit, his penchant for illegal gambling repeatedly brought him into conflict with the state. He was eventually sentenced to forced labor.</p>\n<p>After spending several years in a labor prison, Ivan was given a choice: continue his grueling sentence or sign a decades-long contract to work on the underwater station. He reluctantly chose the latter.</p>\n<p>A recent arrival at the station, Ivan has proven to be a thorn in the side of seasoned workers like <strong>Liu</strong>, whom he constantly antagonizes. His rebellious attitude and disciplinary issues have led to him being barred from joining the other workers on most tasks, relegating him to menial jobs like cleaning latrines in the habitation area.</p>\n<p>Though outwardly defiant, Ivan dreams of escaping what he sees as a life of slavery and charting his own course. He only trusts a few people, and most of the station&rsquo;s staff are not on that list.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
    "adhocitems": ""
  },
